{"text": "Crafting

Use the recipe book to craft. It shows locked recipes too. Its lightning toggle enables instant crafting. Shift crafts a batch.

Hover an inventory item: R shows recipes; U shows uses. JEI covers modded machines too."}

{"text": "Storage

IPN sorts and refills depleted stacks. Its continuous crafting is off. Tom’s terminal searches connected storage.

InvMove allows walking with inventories open. Focus a search field before typing."}
